WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Select tokens precisely. Reuse across many steps.

00:05.000 --> 00:13.000
Group similar queries into equal-size GPU tiles.

00:13.000 --> 00:21.000
Use exact attention mass to select individual KV tokens.

00:21.000 --> 00:28.000
Cache the dense–sparse output residual.

00:28.000 --> 00:39.000
Reuse metadata with fresh Q, K, and V at each step.

00:39.000 --> 00:44.000
Refresh the cache at the next anchor, then reuse again.

00:44.000 --> 00:48.000
Training-free acceleration for video and 3D generation.
